message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "kemproof"
abstract: "Attest that an ML-KEM-768 key exchange really happened: the prover shows, with a key confirmation, that it reached the same shared secret, and the exchange is recorded with an expiry. It does not encrypt anything, and the README says so first. Built for AEGIS."
